OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will spread into the west this
OL,7,Fevening, mainly dry across the east.
OL,8,FThe rest of the night will be cloudy
OL,9,Fwith outbreaks of rain, mainly in west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FMostly cloudy with outbreaks
OL,12,Fof rain, but drier and occasionally
OL,13,Fbrighter around Inverness and Nairn.
OL,14,FFresh southwesterly winds,
OL,15,Foccasionally strong in the northwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fand breezy on Saturday with spells of
OL,19,Frain, this most persistent in the west
OL,20,Fbut drier spells in the east. Early
OL,21,Frain on Sunday then dry. Dry Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
